ment-3411498112","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111457","id":3411498112,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7LV1SA","user":{"login":"betalars","id":18014034,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDE0MDM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18014034?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/betalars","html_url":"https://github.com/betalars","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/betalars/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/betalars/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/betalars/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/betalars/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/betalars/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/betalars/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/betalars/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/betalars/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/betalars/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-16T15:38:41Z","updated_at":"2025-10-16T15:39:44Z","body":"> You are literally comparing the reflection of spheres in blender to the specular highlight in Godot. Those things are not the same. If you are unwilling to do a proper comparison than there is nothing we can help you with. This is not a big.\n\nThe **Spheres**  are only **visual aids** to help you understand the size and brightness of the reflections. They do not have any influence on the reflections because I switched that off in blender.\n\nBut I will happily delete the spheres and the skybox if it helps you visualize. This one is comparing eevee and godot.\n\n<img width=\"1420\" height=\"792\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e9fa8a6d-7623-4188-a100-3f13cd7f7373\" />\n\n<img width=\"1420\" height=\"792\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7f7f14d7-14ca-4d61-8566-86a